        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_07",
      "hash64": "C9E4B85455269C3D",
      "text": "O sea, Ricardo, ¡no sé qué hacer!\\c\\n¿Crees que se sentirá ofendid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa si le pido que me\\nestreche la mano? ¡¿Y si le pido un autógrafo?![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_05",
      "hash64": "F2AB872F8DFAE719",
      "text": "¡Calma, Enrica! ¡Seguro que no muerde![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_08",
      "hash64": "C9E4A954552682C0",
      "text": "Ay, perdóname... ¡Es que, o sea, no estoy nada\\nacostumbrada a tratar con la clase baja![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_06",
      "hash64": "F2AB842F8DFAE200",
      "text": "No es culpa tuya, cielo. Siendo la presidenta\\nde Inmobiliaria Paldea, tienes tanto que hacer...[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_09",
      "hash64": "C9E4AA5455268473",
      "text": "Esto... Disculpa, joven plebey[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_10",
      "hash64": "C9E837545529A9E1",
      "text": "¿Serías tan amable de aceptar mi desafío a un\\nduelo Pokémon?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_11",
      "hash64": "C9E836545529A82E",
      "text": "O sea, si me ganas, te daré parte de mi fortuna.\\n¡No me dolerán prendas de marca en hacerlo![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_07",
      "hash64": "F2AB852F8DFAE3B3",
      "text": "¡Ay, Enrica! ¡Tú siempre tan rumbosa![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_11",
      "hash64": "F2AF0F2F8DFE0408",
      "text": "¡Cuánto te gusta dar oportunidades a la plebe![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_12",
      "hash64": "C9E835545529A67B",
      "text": "Jo, jo, jo... Si aceptas mi desafío, plebey[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa,\\naquí te estaré esperando.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_npc",
      "hash64": "F67D01CCEA4BEA0D",
      "text": "Enrica te pone en bandeja de plata un fortunón.\\nSi lo quieres, sé un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a buen[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a plebey[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa y díselo.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
